    {
      "id": "cdn",
      "chapter": "How to cut it",
      "narration": "So how do we cut latency? First, move the data closer. A content delivery network keeps copies of a site on servers around the world, so your request travels a few hundred kilometres instead of crossing an ocean.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 10,
          "size": 8,
          "text": "1. Move the data closer",
          "draw": 0.6,
          "at": "closer"
        },
